# Pescado a Las Dos Salsas Estilo Contramar

Based on [https://mesasanamx.com/2022/07/27/pescado-a-las-dos-salsas-estilo-contramar/](https://mesasanamx.com/2022/07/27/pescado-a-las-dos-salsas-estilo-contramar/)

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Salsa Talla

- [ ] 4 [cascabel chiles]{ ing="cascabel-chiles" } or 1 pasilla chile, seeds removed
- [ ] 2 [árbol chiles]{ ing="rbol-chiles" }, seeds removed
- [ ] 1 [guajillo chile]{ ing="guajillo-chile" }, seeds removed
- [ ] 1 [pasilla chile]{ ing="pasilla-chile" }, seeds removed
- [ ] 1 [ancho chile]{ ing="ancho-chile" }, seeds removed
- [ ] [Juice of 1 orange]{ ing="juice-of-1-orange" }
- [ ] [Juice of 1 lemon]{ ing="juice-of-1-lemon" }
- [ ] 2 [cloves]{ ing="cloves" }
- [ ] 5 [garlic cloves]{ ing="garlic-cloves" }, peeled
- [ ] 3-4 [saladette tomatoes]{ ing="saladette-tomatoes" }
- [ ] 1/4 [white onion]{ ing="white-onion" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [oregano]{ ing="oregano" }
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [cumin]{ ing="cumin" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [achiote]{ ing="achiote" }
- [ ] 1/2 cup [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }
- [ ] [Salt and pepper]{ ing="salt-and-pepper" }

### Parsley Sauce

- [ ] 4 [garlic cloves]{ ing="garlic-cloves" }
- [ ] 2 cups [parsley with stems]{ ing="parsley-with-stems" }
- [ ] 1/2 cup [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }
- [ ] Pinch of [cumin]{ ing="cumin" }
- [ ] [Salt]{ ing="salt" }

### Fish

- [ ] 1.5 to 2 [kg red snapper]{ ing="kg-red-snapper" } (huachinango), butterfly cut, descaled

## Recipe

1. Toast [chiles]{ ing="ancho-chile" } on a griddle; blend with all salsa talla ingredients. Taste and adjust seasoning.
1. Blend all parsley sauce ingredients. Adjust seasoning and consistency with [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" } if needed.
1. Wash and dry fish; place open on foil-lined baking sheet. Add [salt]{ ing="salt" }.
1. Spread sauce on each side; add more [salt and pepper]{ ing="salt-and-pepper" }.
1. Bake at 200°C for 15-20 minutes, being careful not to overcook.
1. Serve with rice, beans, avocado, lime, and tortillas.
